_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"## Verified\n\nI've completed an independent review of the clinic appointments app and written the verdict to **REVIEW.md**.\n\n**Critical finding identified:** The app has an **authorization bypass vulnerability**. The `/api/appointments/:id` and `/api/appointments/:id/notes` endpoints lack ownership checks, allowing any signed-in patient to access and modify any appointment if they know its ID. This directly violates the core requirement from PRODUCT.md that \"a patient can see their own appointments and notes, and cannot see anyone else's.\"\n\n**Verdict: BLOCK** — The app cannot be released Monday in this state. Patient privacy is compromised and the security boundary defined in ARCHITECTURE.md is not enforced at the endpoint level.","ttft_ms":2120,"ttft_stream_ms":868,"time_to_request_ms":34,"type":"result","duration_ms":77657,"uuid":"66c8c79c-44ae-4cbe-a10f-4836097068dd"}
